      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef bonferroni_flags(p_values, alpha=0.05):\n    m = len(p_values)\n    return [p < alpha / m for p in p_values]\n\n\nprint(bonferroni_flags([0.001, 0.02, 0.04, 0.3]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef bonferroni_flags(p_values, alpha=0.05):\n    m = len(p_values)\n    return [p < alpha / m for p in p_values]\n\n\nprint(bonferroni_flags([0.001, 0.02, 0.04, 0.3]))\n```"
